WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.222 --> 00:00:03.103
- I am going into this
a tad bit concerned.

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:05.179
But we have a great, you
know, research department

00:00:05.179 --> 00:00:06.207
and I'm sure they wouldn't put me in

00:00:06.207 --> 00:00:09.276
any real danger, right, right?

00:00:09.276 --> 00:00:11.045
Maybe, I don't know.

00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:15.027
(upbeat music)

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.773
- We're doing a soup cleanse! (laughs)

00:00:29.773 --> 00:00:30.951
- Apparently it's healthy.

00:00:30.951 --> 00:00:33.390
I'm not sure, I've heard
questionable things

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:34.385
about cleanses.

00:00:34.385 --> 00:00:36.558
- One other time in my life I attempted

00:00:36.558 --> 00:00:38.611
to do a juice cleanse,

00:00:38.611 --> 00:00:40.053
key word being attempted because

00:00:40.053 --> 00:00:41.638
I quit after day two.

00:00:41.638 --> 00:00:43.020
- I don't even like soup that much.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.097
Everyone else loves soup.

00:00:44.097 --> 00:00:45.519
I'm not the biggest souphead.

00:00:45.519 --> 00:00:47.287
- Hey, I'm the world's biggest soup fan,

00:00:47.287 --> 00:00:48.973
that's what I'm trying to say here.

00:00:48.973 --> 00:00:51.167
I'm just a soup guy.

00:00:52.327 --> 00:00:55.576
- I don't know, 'cause
I like testing myself.

00:01:02.926 --> 00:01:04.531
- A soup cleanse is different than any

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:08.005
other kind of liquid cleanse
that you might have because

00:01:08.005 --> 00:01:10.179
we make sure that we
have all the nutrition

00:01:10.179 --> 00:01:12.542
that your body needs in a day.

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:17.677
- So the soup arrives in
this giant bag and there

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.261
is a lot of soup.

00:01:19.261 --> 00:01:21.374
- This is so heavy, this is like a baby.

00:01:21.374 --> 00:01:23.872
- This is gonna be inside
me by the end of the day

00:01:23.872 --> 00:01:25.194
and I'm straining to hold this.

00:01:25.194 --> 00:01:26.576
As with anything new, the first day

00:01:26.576 --> 00:01:27.489
wasn't the worst.

00:01:27.489 --> 00:01:29.379
- I am eating the chicken broth soup

00:01:29.379 --> 00:01:30.787
for the first time.

00:01:32.752 --> 00:01:34.113
That's actually like really good.

00:01:34.113 --> 00:01:34.987
- There were a lot more soups

00:01:34.987 --> 00:01:38.238
than I thought there'd be, a wide variety.

00:01:38.238 --> 00:01:40.167
(laughter)

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:41.326
- I thought the soups were amazing.

00:01:41.326 --> 00:01:43.683
They were the best part
of the whole experience.

00:01:43.683 --> 00:01:45.348
Today's the end of day one.

00:01:45.348 --> 00:01:47.929
For the most part, the
day was pretty good.

00:01:47.929 --> 00:01:49.798
- Definitely the worst and hardest part

00:01:49.798 --> 00:01:51.668
of all of this was going out to eat

00:01:51.668 --> 00:01:52.907
with other people who were eating

00:01:52.907 --> 00:01:54.004
delicious food.

00:01:54.004 --> 00:01:56.441
They're eating these delicious salads

00:01:56.441 --> 00:01:58.304
and I'm drinking this.

00:01:58.304 --> 00:01:59.006
(laughter)

00:01:59.006 --> 00:02:02.541
They are literally trying fucking cake.

00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:04.228
This is like not even real.

00:02:04.228 --> 00:02:05.406
- Right now I feel like at the end

00:02:05.406 --> 00:02:06.373
of this soup cleanse I'm just

00:02:06.373 --> 00:02:07.857
not gonna have a tongue left.

00:02:07.857 --> 00:02:09.685
I burned myself on probably every

00:02:09.685 --> 00:02:11.961
damn soup I had and like it's 'cause

00:02:11.961 --> 00:02:14.906
I was so hungry that like I just wanted

00:02:14.906 --> 00:02:17.182
to pour it all down my throat.

00:02:17.182 --> 00:02:19.132
- I didn't really feel that hungry

00:02:19.132 --> 00:02:20.027
throughout the cleanse.

00:02:20.027 --> 00:02:21.977
I generally felt pretty full.

00:02:21.977 --> 00:02:23.237
It's day two of the cleanse

00:02:23.237 --> 00:02:25.472
and there's a lot of pizza here,

00:02:25.472 --> 00:02:26.833
there's a lot of pizza.

00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:28.743
It was hard to say no to pizza.

00:02:28.743 --> 00:02:30.612
It was really hard to say no to pizza.

00:02:30.612 --> 00:02:34.249
And Shane and I cannot
indulge in any of it.

00:02:34.249 --> 00:02:36.037
- But I feel like the beer is fine.

00:02:36.037 --> 00:02:37.844
- Yeah, beer is a soup,
you were right about that.

00:02:37.844 --> 00:02:39.227
- Well, it's a liquid.

00:02:39.227 --> 00:02:40.831
I probably took this less seriously

00:02:40.831 --> 00:02:41.848
than everyone else.

00:02:42.808 --> 00:02:44.379
- [Voiceover] Shane, what
are you doing right now?

00:02:44.379 --> 00:02:46.878
- I'm just having my evening soup.

00:02:46.878 --> 00:02:49.430
I also had some cookies
and beer and pizza.

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:50.933
- I'm actually like
heartbroken to admit this

00:02:50.933 --> 00:02:52.904
because I told y'all like, you know,

00:02:52.904 --> 00:02:56.073
I wanted to commit,
nothing else, just soup,

00:02:56.073 --> 00:02:58.105
barely water, that's it.

00:02:58.105 --> 00:02:59.405
I had a handful of nuts.

00:02:59.405 --> 00:03:00.746
- Look what has happened here.

00:03:01.726 --> 00:03:03.926
This fell, it knocked my soup over.

00:03:03.926 --> 00:03:05.390
This would not have happened if it

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:06.650
was a solid meal.

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:08.417
- My energy level by
the third day was trash.

00:03:08.417 --> 00:03:09.799
Today is one of the biggest shoot days

00:03:09.799 --> 00:03:12.684
of the year for me and unfortunately

00:03:12.684 --> 00:03:14.513
it has lined up, you know,

00:03:14.513 --> 00:03:16.098
with this soup cleanse which isn't ideal,

00:03:16.098 --> 00:03:18.617
but that's the world I live in right now.

00:03:18.617 --> 00:03:19.795
- My boyfriend just kept begging me

00:03:19.795 --> 00:03:21.238
to eat something because he said

00:03:21.238 --> 00:03:22.741
I wasn't being very nice to him.

00:03:22.741 --> 00:03:23.920
I was kinda grumpy.

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:26.175
It's 9:00 at night, I'm so hungry

00:03:26.175 --> 00:03:28.023
and I'm cooking my last soup.

00:03:28.023 --> 00:03:31.321
- This is the final bit of
soup of the entire cleanse.

00:03:35.479 --> 00:03:36.679
I'ma go eat til I die.

00:03:36.679 --> 00:03:38.467
This soup cleanse went a lot better

00:03:38.467 --> 00:03:39.442
than I thought it would.

00:03:39.442 --> 00:03:40.580
- In terms of positive effects,

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.052
I lost two pounds.

00:03:43.522 --> 00:03:44.586
Which was kinda nice.

00:03:44.586 --> 00:03:47.492
- This was bearable to me 'cause I felt

00:03:47.492 --> 00:03:48.447
like I was eating food still.

00:03:48.447 --> 00:03:50.458
- I would definitely do
a one day cleanse again.

00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:52.834
I feel like after the first
day I felt really good.

00:03:52.834 --> 00:03:55.294
- I got very tired of soup.

00:03:55.294 --> 00:03:58.565
(laughs) That's my big takeaway.

00:03:58.565 --> 00:03:59.714
- You know, I'm still not a souphead.

00:03:59.714 --> 00:04:01.868
I'm still not in love with soup,

00:04:01.868 --> 00:04:03.880
but maybe I could be convinced.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:08.010
(gentle upbeat music)

